Spec: Shared Android Binder wire contract

Purpose:
  Provide a single generated AIDL interface without application implementation or permissions.

Must:
  Append the optional private data attachment transaction without changing existing request transaction identity.
  Return a one-use caller-bound descriptor only when the host advertises secure streams; read-only hosts reject it.
  Descriptor replies use @StreamAttachment status `0` success, `1` auth, `2` stopped, `3` capacity, `4` invalid, `5` unsupported, `6` storage; propagate return-value descriptor ownership through parceling.
  Append formal stream-reference attachment after existing transactions; experimental operation attachment retains its original transaction and meaning.

Owns:
  ./build.gradle
  ./src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
  ./src/main/aidl/dev/linkgate/broker/ILinkGateControl.aidl
  ./src/main/aidl/dev/linkgate/broker/StreamAttachment.aidl
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/broker/StreamAttachment.java
